# In-app staff notifications

Distinct from `/dashboard/settings/notifications` (patient reminder prefs).

## Rules

- Always insert via `create_notification` / emit helpers in `notification_service.py`. Never raw SQL at call sites.
- Non-fatal: notification failure must not fail the booking/visit/billing write.
- Dedupe: partial unique `(clinic_id, type, dedupe_key)`. Coalesce only for `messaging.inbound`.
- Per-user read: `notification_reads`; no shared `read_at` on `notifications`.
- Realtime: publish Redis → `/ws/clinic/{id}` as `notification.created` / `notification.updated`.
- PHI: titles/bodies use patient display names only; no SOAP, Rx, phone, or transcript text.
- Suppress toast when `actor_user_id ===` current user; still persist for others.
- Do not emit from AI assistant layer if the underlying service already emits.

